graph TD
    Start[Start Process] -->|User Input| Decision{Choose Option}
    Decision -->|Option A| ProcessA[Process A]
    Decision -->|Option B| ProcessB[Process B]
    Decision -->|Option C| ProcessC[Process C]

    ProcessA --> Result[Show Result]
    ProcessB --> Result
    ProcessC --> Result

    Result --> End[End]

    click Start callback "This is a clickable node"
    click ProcessA callback "You clicked Process A"
    click ProcessB callback "You clicked Process B"
    click ProcessC callback "You clicked Process C"

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style Decision fill:#fff3cd
    style Result fill:#d1ecf1
    style End fill:#f8d7da
